      by the `placement` command. DealsDesk consumes that
      readout as a NEED and builds/provisions the nodes to
      the segment's spec — the same find-the-items role it
      already plays for hosting, extended to whole nodes.
      Segments exist so domains do not mix resources
      (Brian: the MLM segment is 'a little segment of nodes
      somewhere' and doesn't need to mix with crypto).
  R15. PLACEMENT FOLLOWS WHAT A THING IS — NEVER WHAT IT
