  R20. TRACKED COMPANIES (Brian, 2026-10-23: 'companies:
      Anthropic, Open AI, Nvidia, AMD, Intel ....'). The
      company twin of R19: a company Brian names for
      tracking gets its own dossier body — sourced public
      announcements, product and market moves, and Brian's
      analysis. Vendor dealings (quotes, orders,
      support) live with the desk or project that deals;
