      home-lab / the builds bodies. Others join when
      named or when his fleet actually runs them.
  R22. FAVORITE MACHINE MAKERS (Brian, 2026-10-23: 'each
      of my favorite machines: GMK Tec, Aoostar,
      Minisforum, others'). Each machine maker Brian
