      not mere vendors in the companies watch list,
      they are the brands his fleet is built from.
      Purchase hunts stay in DealsDesk (R14's find-the-
      items role); hardware-class knowledge stays in
      the builds bodies. Others join when named.
  R23. THE DISLIKE REGISTRY (Brian, 2026-10-23: 'maybe a
      workspace of things Brian doesn't like — apple,
      iphones, chocolate, onions'). The personal twin
      of R8/R18: ONE body — things-brian-doesnt-like —
