      never workspaces of their own. determine() checks
      DISLIKES before owner matching, so a disliked
      subject can never be promoted to a body. Charter
      entries: #APPLE, #IPHONES, #CHOCOLATE, #ONIONS —
      joined minutes later at the same 'extremely
      strong hatred' strength (Brian, 2026-10-23) by
      #DEMOCRATS, #SATANISTS, #MEN-IN-WOMENS-SPORTS
