      something out, I think an anythingllm workspace
      needs to be created to dump ideas that I'm
      working with to help me plan it'). Starting a plan
      creates its own workspace — plan-<subject> — the
      idea dump for that plan, seeded with the planning
      template. While a plan is ACTIVE, determine()
      routes its subject's material to the planning
      body (after the negative registries, before owner
