      until it crosses the line or the research kills
      it, with the why recorded. The board also works
      four standing IMPROVEMENT FRONTS, each a research
      beat: ways we can get better in the future; ways
      to improve ecosystem efficiency; ways to do
      things better and burn fewer tokens; ways to
      burn less energy while keeping the budget. A
      front with no open research orders is a gap the
      brief names. (The harness gate.py 0.90 heuristic
