Registry: atlas.allm_workspace_registry (ecosystem_central), seeded
idempotently from this file. Live truth (which workspaces exist and
their document counts) is read from AnythingLLM's own database,
read-only. Determined workspaces are created inside AnythingLLM
via its API (key wired into successbrian-os/.env, 2026-10-22);
status 'live' means the workspace exists there.

CLI:
  allm_workspaces.py list                 registry vs live counts
  allm_workspaces.py determine <subject> [--category C]
  allm_workspaces.py audit                drift report
  allm_workspaces.py seed                 (re)seed registry + sync nodes
  allm_workspaces.py selftest             assert the rules hold
